---
description: Mandatory SheldonTwitching cabinet pixel art preservation
alwaysApply: true
---

- Read docs/command-center/PIXEL_ART_CONTRACT.md before changing cabinet art or materials.
- Pixel art is mandatory for balltop, shaft, buttons, cabinet and animated scenes.
- Preserve native sprite alpha, pixel clusters, dithering, highlights and shadows; nearest-neighbor rendering only.
- Never replace source control shading with smooth procedural sphere/3D shaders, blur or gradients.
- Palette changes may recolor authored pixels; custom lighting requires authored pixel masks and visual acceptance.
- Paint must cover registered panel faces fully while staying out of independently colored trim.
- Review native and gameplay renders plus enlarged control crops before shipping.
